  "details": "The official documentation mentions that we can use the float values of GestureLeft/Right Weight for analog input on various gestures, but only reports as 0 and 1 for anything that isn't Gesture Index 1 (Fist).\nIt not only appears to be an oversight, as the documentation suggests we should have access on other gestures; Freeing up this analog value would be incredibly useful for more analog avatar features without relying on menus or questionable contact receiver implementations.",
